  (text "What this does: Shows basic power/readiness status and provides audible bench/startup feedback without a display.\nConnects to: Flight PD7 -> complementary red/green LEDs; comms and hardware power have separate LEDs. Flight PD6 -> passive piezo. Green means checks passed, not armed."
    (at 15.24 27.94 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "db46f36d-755c-56ed-9c1f-2a86cd122480")))
